{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the life of Albion's most magical apprentice maid!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Niziiro Mao, a happy-go-lucky Ink Mage who happens to be working as a maid in the royal palace. A maid's work is never done, but her majesty will forgive you if you slack off once in a while.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carpe diem! It's a fancy phrase her majesty taught you that means something or another! Whether it's focusing on your studies, working hard at your part time jobs, or going on walks to meet new people, every choice you make gets you closer to who you want to become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, climb the tower, and, if her majesty thinks you're ready, go on big adventures while carrying out her missions. If you run into any bad guys, defeat them with the awesome power of your brand new spell cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute fantasy raising simulation. A relaxed and cozy glimpse into the daily life of a cheerful, outgoing, and slightly lazy maid (witch) in training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eb2d0319afa38081a4fcbf7652daa018.poster.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eb2d0319afa38081a4fcbf7652daa018.webm?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eb2d0319afa38081a4fcbf7652daa018.mp4?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/9b0df39b8abf3147baf08fea15bed1d3.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what to do every day. It's a student's job to go to school, but maybe spending the whole day studying is pushing it a bit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/0720f5839cb5fe825be927e858bb3132.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things get too stressful, take a walk outside the city, eat something delicious, or have a nice nap to keep yourself rested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/82f0c72fbc8fd828208fb2495bb5f4c0.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her majesty has a considerably laissez-faire approach to education, so you are free to make your own schedule. However, although her backing means you can try any job or class you'd like, you still need to work hard yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/4d4c209978e7bc4c85a03733c044b576.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things seem too boring, you can always try climbing the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/cc2e46e6ff735b1e54ad9c81966d423f.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...But maybe you should consider working on your stats a little before rushing inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/84ff59cbc4873e1b12b608bea2ffa8ff.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her majesty gave you a starting deck of spell cards as a gift, but you're free to sell the ones you don't need or buy new ones from the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eec8315bd7345765738e20ce98f063bc.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you level up (by playing children's card games, attending school, or working part time jobs), use talent points to decide how you want to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/64ce823a101b3ffc1810a5a45bddf4ae.poster.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/64ce823a101b3ffc1810a5a45bddf4ae.webm?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/64ce823a101b3ffc1810a5a45bddf4ae.mp4?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in development for PC and Android.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552520?t=1762105942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552520?t=1762105942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/f96ba65236153b64fc498c815d5e1a96268f6294/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762105942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/f96ba65236153b64fc498c815d5e1a96268f6294/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762105942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3637780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the life of Albion's most magical apprentice maid!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Niziiro Mao, a happy-go-lucky Ink Mage who happens to be working as a maid in the royal palace. A maid's work is never done, but her majesty will forgive you if you slack off once in a while.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carpe diem! It's a fancy phrase her majesty taught you that means something or another! Whether it's focusing on your studies, working hard at your part time jobs, or going on walks to meet new people, every choice you make gets you closer to who you want to become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, climb the tower, and, if her majesty thinks you're ready, go on big adventures while carrying out her missions. If you run into any bad guys, defeat them with the awesome power of your brand new spell cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute fantasy raising simulation. A relaxed and cozy glimpse into the daily life of a cheerful, outgoing, and slightly lazy maid (witch) in training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eb2d0319afa38081a4fcbf7652daa018.poster.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eb2d0319afa38081a4fcbf7652daa018.webm?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eb2d0319afa38081a4fcbf7652daa018.mp4?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/9b0df39b8abf3147baf08fea15bed1d3.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what to do every day. It's a student's job to go to school, but maybe spending the whole day studying is pushing it a bit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/0720f5839cb5fe825be927e858bb3132.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things get too stressful, take a walk outside the city, eat something delicious, or have a nice nap to keep yourself rested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/82f0c72fbc8fd828208fb2495bb5f4c0.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her majesty has a considerably laissez-faire approach to education, so you are free to make your own schedule. However, although her backing means you can try any job or class you'd like, you still need to work hard yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/4d4c209978e7bc4c85a03733c044b576.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things seem too boring, you can always try climbing the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/cc2e46e6ff735b1e54ad9c81966d423f.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...But maybe you should consider working on your stats a little before rushing inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/84ff59cbc4873e1b12b608bea2ffa8ff.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her majesty gave you a starting deck of spell cards as a gift, but you're free to sell the ones you don't need or buy new ones from the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/eec8315bd7345765738e20ce98f063bc.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you level up (by playing children's card games, attending school, or working part time jobs), use talent points to decide how you want to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/64ce823a101b3ffc1810a5a45bddf4ae.poster.avif?t=1762105942\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/64ce823a101b3ffc1810a5a45bddf4ae.webm?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/64ce823a101b3ffc1810a5a45bddf4ae.mp4?t=1762105942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in development for PC and Android.</p>","developers":["Sleepy Cat Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/8d876c4b1db6096b43e73c8ff6d6ea25c154e378/header.jpg?t=1762105942","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552520/1943534435/f3f6260068cc6b5fec935c2ffc4ac37c104bd8b3/1762104401/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762105941","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552520/1943534435/f3f6260068cc6b5fec935c2ffc4ac37c104bd8b3/1762104401/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762105941","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552520/1943534435/f3f6260068cc6b5fec935c2ffc4ac37c104bd8b3/1762104401/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762105941","id":257200792,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200792/97dced52454752db005c903ddedfcabce8860427/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762105941"}],"name":"Raising Niziiro: Albion's Witch","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommend